#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:1 of
msgid "Provide rolling-window calculations within each group."
msgstr "提供每个组内的滚动窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:3 of
msgid ""
"The data is partitioned by the group key (hash shuffle) so that every "
"group resides in a single partition; the rolling aggregation is then "
"computed per-group. Only integer window sizes are supported."
msgstr ""
"数据按分组键(哈希混洗)进行分区，以便每个组都驻留在单个分区中；然后逐组"
"计算滚动聚合。仅支持整数窗口大小。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:7 of
msgid "Size of the moving window (number of rows). Must be positive."
msgstr "移动窗口的大小(行数)。必须为正数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:9 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in a window required to produce a value ("
"otherwise null). Defaults to ``window`` (matching pandas). For ``count`` "
"the value is the number of non-null observations, but ``min_periods`` "
"still gates on the number of window rows (observations), not the non-null"
" count — consistent with pandas."
msgstr ""
"窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数(否则为null)。默认为 ``window`` (匹配pandas)"
"。对于 ``count`` 值是非空观测的数量，但 ``min_periods`` 仍然基于窗口行数("
"观测数)，而不是非空计数——与pandas一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:15 of
msgid "Center the window on the current row."
msgstr "将窗口居中在当前行上。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:17 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all non-group-key columns are "
"aggregated. Non-selected columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为None，则聚合所有非分组键列。未选择的列保持不变。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:21 of
msgid ""
"Intermediate object; call an aggregation method (e.g. ``.sum()``) to "
"produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法(例如 ``.sum()``)来生成LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:26 of
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:28 of
msgid ""
"Grouped transforms hash-shuffle rows by group key, so the output row "
"order follows reducer/hash-partition order and is **not** aligned with "
"the input frame (unlike pandas, which preserves the index). Order "
"restoration via a place-back operator (``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``) is "
"planned; see ``docs/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``."
msgstr ""
"分组变换通过分组键对行进行哈希混洗，因此输出行顺序遵循reducer/hash-"
"partition顺序，与输入框架**不**对齐(不像pandas那样保留索引)。通过place-"
"back操作符(``LiteFrameIlocSetItem``)恢复顺序的计划正在进行中；参见 ``docs"
"/designs/liteframe/operators/window.md``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:34 of
msgid ""
"Null-key rows are preserved with a null result (matching the other "
"grouped transforms and the row-count-preserving transform contract); they"
" are not grouped together. (This diverges from pandas grouped-rolling, "
"which drops null-key rows under ``dropna=True``.)"
msgstr ""
"空键行以空结果保留(与其他分组变换和行数保持变换契约匹配)；它们不会被分组"
"在一起。(这与pandas分组滚动不同，pandas在 ``dropna=True`` 下会丢弃空键行"
"。)"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:39 of
msgid "If ``window`` is not an integer."
msgstr "如果 ``window`` 不是整数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.rolling:40 of
msgid "If ``window`` is not positive or ``min_periods`` is invalid."
msgstr "如果 ``window`` 不为正数或 ``min_periods`` 无效。"

